              }
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "**Weekly high-temperature cycle · Not enabled**\nPrepared for Monday 06:00, using the boiler's separate 65°C hygiene target and existing 10-minute dwell setting. Mixing protection and treatment of the potable-water coil still need confirmation; the proposal has not been applied.\n\nNative function: **{{ state_attr('sensor.bsb_hygiene_function_readback','payload') | default('Waiting for fresh reading', true) }}**\nNative hygiene target: {{ state_attr('sensor.bsb_hygiene_target_readback','payload') | default('Unknown', true) }}°C · dwell: {{ state_attr('sensor.bsb_hygiene_dwell_readback','payload') | default('Unknown', true) }} min.\n\nThe Honeywell motorised valve in the photos does not establish a thermostatic tap-water mixer. [Heating map](/bms-overview/heating-map)"
            },
            {
              "type": "calendar",
              "entities": [
                "calendar.dhw_heating"
