              "content": "<a href=\"/local/bsb-lan/system-map.svg?v=20261015-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open larger map</a> · Tap the map to enlarge. **Solid lines** show the tank's separate internal fluid paths; **dashed lines** are inferred house connections that need tracing. This is an identification map, not a wiring or valve-operation plan.\n\n**500 L is heating water.** Hot tap water runs through the separate stainless coil. The visible Honeywell VC4013 is a motorised routing valve; a thermostatic tap-water mixer has not been identified. The black four-port unit is a likely hydraulic separator, with its model still unverified.\n\n[HAJDU tank description](https://hajdurt.hu/termek/hajdu-pt-cf-erp/42) · [Back to heating controls](/bms-overview/overview)"
