              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "<a href=\"/local/bsb-lan/control-map.svg?v=20261015-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open larger control map</a>\n\n**Tank probe:** traced to the green pair and returned to its original tank pocket by the owner. Likely B3; exact terminal numbers and pocket height still need identification.\n\n**Delta:** the owner reports a boiler heat request and a switched live to the external heating pump, with neutral separate. These are reported functional links, not an electrical inspection. The contact carries On/Off demand, not the measured room temperature.\n\n**A boiler software override cannot power the pump while the Delta relay is off.** Pump operation and radiator circulation have no independent feedback here.\n\n**Native pump output:** a read-only check on 15 October reports QX1 configured as Heating circuit pump HC1 Q2. Which pump it physically controls still needs tracing."
