              "content": "**Still to identify**\n- The exact Honeywell A/B/AB branch destinations and who controls it.\n- The B3 probe's physical port and which store layers it represents.\n- The tap-water outlet path, mixing valve and any circulation loop.\n- Each actual radiator/room-heating zone.\n- The Delta-controlled pump identity, supply routing and boiler contact terminals.\n\nOpening this map sends no heating or valve command. The blue lever valves are isolation valves; their colour does not identify the water circuit."
